- details: the rest (files, commands, caveats, reasoning), grouped under 2-5 short topics.
  Terse points; keep paths and commands exact.
Anywhere: keep MR/issue refs (!123, #45, group/project!123) and URLs exactly as written.

Session focus so far, and the engineer's recent prompts (oldest first):
<previous_focus>
{focus}
</previous_focus>
<recent_prompts>
{recent}
</recent_prompts>

Open items from earlier turns:
<earlier_open>
{earlier}
</earlier_open>

Engineer's prompt:
